    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992110/extras/6351c29ba5e7a5807c729e97120a903e.avif?t=1745953498\" /></div><br>For the nights you spend looking for your wings.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992110/extras/96e913d04c9779e983245455335fd90f.avif?t=1745953498\" /></div><br>This isn't like that. Fight off relentless squares. Start simple, end simple. What happens in between? Everything else.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992110/extras/a598879bcab83c24ed3beb3f44c195fd.poster.avif?t=1745953498\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992110/extras/a598879bcab83c24ed3beb3f44c195fd.webm?t=1745953498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992110/extras/a598879bcab83c24ed3beb3f44c195fd.mp4?t=1745953498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992110/extras/053c787cb14d3964a2964f3c1a5219e0.avif?t=1745953498\" /></div><br>Buy &quot;School Coffee&quot;, &quot;Eye Surgery&quot;, &quot;Regret&quot; or whatever upgrade you might need to beat your enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992110/extras/6821f9b36e3b24b4f64efcc687033550.poster.avif?t=1745953498\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1992110/extras/6821f9b36e3b24b4f64efcc687033550.webm?t=1745953498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https